<</viewAble()/ModDate(D:20211122064420-08'00')/docType(Products End-of-Life Notice)/marketSegment(Service Provider)/Author(Administrator)/title(End-of-Sale and End-of-Life Announcement for the Cisco Nexus 2148T Fabric Extender)/Campaigns()/alfrescoDocVersion()/date(2021-11-22T06:36:41.392-08:00)/concept(Cisco Nexus 2000 Series Fabric Extenders)/Topics()/iaPath(cisco.com#Products#Cisco Products#Switches#Data Center Switches#Cisco Nexus 2000 Series Fabric Extenders)/Creator(þÿ␀M␀i␀c␀r␀o␀s␀o␀f␀t␀®␀ ␀W␀o␀r␀d␀ ␀2␀0␀1␀0)/language(en)/CreationDate(D:20151123150247-06'00')/entitlementExpression(contains\( &quot;0,1,2,3,4,7&quot; , $profileField[3] \))/secondaryConcept()/country(US)/documentId(1637558716072149)/Title(End-of-Sale and End-of-Life Announcement for the Cisco Nexus 2148T Fabric Extender)/contentType(cisco.com#US#preSales)/secondaryDoctype()/accessLevel(Customer,Guest,Partner)/Producer(þÿMicrosoft® Word 2010; modified using iText 2.1.7 by 1T3XT)/alfrescoTraceID()/fireWall()/downLoadable()/autoPlay()/description(Cisco announces the end-of-sale and end-of-life dates for the Cisco Nexus 2148T Fabric Extender. The last day to order the affected product\(s\) is November 24, 2012. Customers with active service contracts will continue to receive support from the Cisco Technical Assistance Center \(TAC\) as shown in Table 1 of the EoL bulletin. Table 1 describes the end-of-life milestones, definitions, and dates for the affected product\(s\). Table 2 lists the product part numbers affected by this announcement. For customers with active and paid service and support contracts, support will be available under the terms and conditions of customers' service contract.)>>
